        "notes": "Two DRACO frames from 158 and 94 seconds before impact. The later partial frame supplies closer detail; the earlier frame supplies wider coverage. The unseen surface keeps the grid. Each image is registered through its archived geometry and checked against the source shape. Brightness is approximately disk-normalized and matched over shared surface patches; shadows remain in the photographs. This is not measured albedo or a post-impact surface.",
